sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as UI / Flow
    participant DP as Data Page Rule
    participant Cache as Rules Cache
    participant Source as Source Rule
    participant DB as Database / API

    UI->>DP: Reference D_Customer[CustomerID:123]
    DP->>Cache: Check cache (load mode + params)
    alt Cache Hit
        Cache-->>DP: Return cached page
    else Cache Miss / Stale
        DP->>Source: Invoke Source
        alt Report Definition
            Source->>DB: Execute SQL
        else Connect-REST
            Source->>DB: HTTP Request
        else Lookup
            Source->>DB: Direct lookup
        end
        DB-->>Source: Data
        Source-->>DP: Populate page
        DP->>Cache: Store per load mode
    end
    DP-->>UI: Return Data Page
